# Cloudflare Worker Site Rule

Use this guidance when working on hosting, deployment, routing, or Worker runtime behavior.

## Platform Direction

- This project deploys via Cloudflare Workers Static Assets.
- Keep the deployment static-first.
- Add Worker fetch logic only when there is a concrete requirement.

## Routing Preferences

- Prefer static routes and `404-page` behavior for this portfolio structure.
- Only switch to SPA fallback if the app is intentionally redesigned as SPA.

## Caching Preferences

- Start with Cloudflare defaults.
- Avoid custom cache rules unless there is a proven need.

